```plantuml
@startuml canary-cv
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam activityBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam noteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fef9c3

title 金丝雀部署 + 持续验证（CV）完整流程

|Harness CD|
start
:创建 Canary 部署;
:部署 5% 流量到 Canary 版本;

|监控系统|
:采集 Canary vs Baseline 指标;
note right
  对比维度：
  • 错误率
  • 响应时间 P99
  • 吞吐量
  • JVM/系统指标
end note

|Harness CV 引擎|
:机器学习基线对比分析;
:计算 Canary Score (0-100);

|Harness CD|
if (Score >= 阈值 如80?) then (是)
    :扩大流量至 20%;
    :继续验证直到 100%;
    :清理 Baseline 版本;
    stop
else (否)
    :自动回滚到 Baseline;
    :发送 Slack/PagerDuty 告警;
    :记录失败原因到 Audit Trail;
    stop
endif

@enduml
```

```plantuml
@startuml gitops-flow
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam componentBorderColor #3b82f6

title Harness GitOps 多集群管理架构

rectangle "Git 仓库\n(Source of Truth)" as git {
    file "app-manifests/\n  prod/deployment.yaml\n  staging/deployment.yaml" as manifests
}

rectangle "Harness 控制平面" as control {
    component "GitOps Service" as gitops_svc
    component "RBAC Engine" as rbac
    component "PR Pipeline Trigger" as pr_pipeline
    component "Drift Detection Dashboard" as drift
}

rectangle "目标集群 - Prod" as prod_cluster {
    component "GitOps Agent (Argo CD)" as agent_prod
}

rectangle "目标集群 - Staging" as staging_cluster {
    component "GitOps Agent (Argo CD)" as agent_staging
}

git --> agent_prod : 监听变更并拉取 (30s)
git --> agent_staging : 监听变更并拉取 (30s)
agent_prod --> control : 上报同步状态
agent_staging --> control : 上报同步状态
control --> agent_prod : 下发 App 定义
control --> agent_staging : 下发 App 定义
pr_pipeline --> git : 自动合并 PR\n(多环境渐进推进)
drift --> control : 展示漂移告警

@enduml
```

```plantuml
@startuml ff-evaluation
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam activityBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam noteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fef9c3

title Feature Flag 本地评估引擎流程

start

:SDK 接收评估请求\n(用户 ID + Flag Key);

:查询本地缓存\n(内存中的规则快照);

note right
  SDK 初始化时同步全量规则
  通过 SSE/轮询保持实时更新
  本地评估无需网络请求，极低延迟
end note

:匹配目标规则 (Targeting Rules);

fork
    :检查用户 ID 白名单;
fork again
    :检查用户属性条件\n(country=CN AND plan=premium);
fork again
    :检查流量百分比规则\n(基于 MurmurHash3 分桶);
end fork

if (命中某条规则?) then (是)
    :返回规则对应的 Variation;
else (否)
    :返回默认 Variation;
endif

:异步批量上报评估事件\n(不阻塞主流程);

:返回 Variation 给业务代码;

stop

@enduml
```

```plantuml
@startuml sto-architecture
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam componentBorderColor #3b82f6

title STO DevSecOps 安全扫描编排架构

rectangle "代码阶段 (Commit/PR)" as code_stage {
    component "SAST 静态代码分析\n(SonarQube, Semgrep)" as sast
    component "Secret Scanning 密钥扫描\n(Gitleaks, Trufflehog)" as secret
}

rectangle "构建阶段 (Build)" as build_stage {
    component "SCA 软件成分分析\n(Snyk, OWASP Dep-Check)" as sca
    component "Container Scanning 镜像扫描\n(Trivy, Prisma Cloud)" as container
}

rectangle "部署阶段 (Deploy)" as deploy_stage {
    component "DAST 动态应用安全\n(OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite)" as dast
    component "IaC Scanning\n(Checkov, Terrascan)" as iac
}

rectangle "STO 核心处理层" as sto_core {
    component "结果规范化 (SARIF 格式统一)" as normalize
    component "智能去重 (跨工具漏洞合并)" as dedup
    component "优先级计算 (CVSS + 业务权重)" as priority
    component "豁免管理 (误报/已知风险标记)" as exemption
}

rectangle "治理与策略层" as governance {
    component "OPA 策略引擎" as opa
    component "Pipeline Break 阻断流水线" as break_gate
    component "安全仪表盘" as dashboard
}

code_stage --> sto_core : 扫描结果
build_stage --> sto_core : 扫描结果
deploy_stage --> sto_core : 扫描结果
normalize --> dedup
dedup --> priority
priority --> exemption
exemption --> opa
opa --> break_gate : Critical 漏洞触发阻断
opa --> dashboard : 可视化报告

@enduml
```

```plantuml
@startuml stripe-swimlane
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activityBorderColor #3b82f6
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #eff6ff
skinparam activityFontColor #1e293b
skinparam activityArrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam noteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fffbeb
skinparam noteFontColor #92400e

title Stripe Agent Harness：任务全生命周期

|任务规范层|
start
:构造结构化任务;
note right
  JSON Task Spec
  goal / scope / context
  validation / constraints
end note

|沙盒执行层|
:启动隔离容器;
note right
  可读写文件
  可执行测试/Linter
  无法触达生产环境
end note
:Agent 开始执行任务;

|反馈循环层|
:运行测试套件;
if (测试全部通过?) then (是)
    :生成 Pull Request;
else (否)
    :读取错误输出 + 错误信息;
    note right
      教学式错误信息
      错误本身即下轮 Context
      引导 Agent 自修复
    end note
    :迭代修复代码;
    if (达到步骤上限?) then (是)
        :标记为需要人工介入;
    else (否)
        :返回运行测试;
        goto 运行测试套件
    endif
endif

|人工审核层|
:正常 Code Review 流程;
:CI 必须全绿方可合并;
stop

@enduml
```
